-----BEGIN ATOMIC-WORKSTATION PLACEHOLDER-----
This is NOT a real key yet.

Generate the real key pair and replace this file:

    ./scripts/init-signing.sh

cosign.pub (this file) is committed to git and stays PUBLIC.
cosign.key (the private key) NEVER goes into git — the script above
creates it locally and you store it as the GitHub Actions repository
secret SIGNING_SECRET. See docs/security.md and docs/installation.md.
